            "review_text": "Furni p\n1 contribution\n0\nGood experience\nJul 2026 • Family\nVery good pizza \nPenne arrabbiata\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten July 18, 2026\nQuest46014431033\nDear Valued Guest,\n\nThank you for your wonderful review! We are delighted to hear that you had a great experience with us and especially enjoyed our pizza and Penne Arrabbiata. Your kind words mean a lot to our team.\n\nWe truly appreciate your support and look forward to welcoming you back to Il Tramonto for another memorable dining experience.\n\nWarm regards,\nIL Tramonto Team\nRead more\nWritten July 20, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
