            "review_text": "Wong201\nTreharris, United Kingdom73 contributions\n0\nFabulous service and food pasta dishes very fresh , staff attentive same service on the 2 nights we visited.\nSep 2025 • Friends\nExcellent service and food pasta dishes- visited here for 2 nights and excellent both times. Staff are so polite and friendly\nWritten September 9, 2025\nQuest46014431033\nDear Susan B,\n\nThank you for sharing your experience. We’re delighted to know that you enjoyed the fresh pasta dishes and attentive service during both of your visits. Your kind words for our team will be shared with them as a wonderful encouragement. On your next stay, we also invite you to discover Daily Social, Wok & Curry, Flavor Fair, Unspoken Bar, and Pool Bar for more memorable dining experiences. \n\nIt would be our pleasure to welcome you back again soon.\n\nBest regards,\nIL Tramonto Team.\nRead more\nWritten September 15, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
