            "review_title": "Review at IL Tramonto",
            "review_text": "foodieJeet\nMumbai, India42 contributions\n0\nBest vegetarian in Phu quoc\nAug 2025 • Family\nArjun was a great help. Surprise to see a great veg restaurant in Phu quoc and exceptionally good and courteous staff . Missed the biryani here since some shortage of rice grains : they say it gets imported from India\nInsider tip:\nDo order mix vegetable and butter naan\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 3, 2025\nQuest46014431033\nDear foodieJeet,\n\nThank you for your kind feedback. We are delighted to know that you enjoyed the vegetarian options and that Arjun and our team’s courteous service made your visit pleasant. We truly appreciate your understanding regarding the biryani, as some ingredients are specially sourced from India to maintain authenticity.\n\nOn your next visit, we warmly invite you to discover more dining experiences across our restaurants, including Flavor Fair, Daily Social, Wok & Curry, Unspoken Bar, and Pool Bar, for even more diverse culinary journeys. We look forward to welcoming you back soon.\n\nSincerely,\nIL Tramonto Team\nRead more\nWritten September 5, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
