            "review_title": "Review at IL Tramonto",
            "review_text": "Getaway23774218159\n2 contributions\n0\nWorld class Italian Restaurant in Phu Quoc\nAug 2025 • Family\nAmazing Italian cuisine (pizza and pastas), with super high quality ingredients. A heaven for vegetarians as the vegetables are out of this world. The pizza is definitely one of the best I have ever eaten.\nInsider tip:\nAwesome vegetarian options. Should try the seafood as Phu Quoc is a seafood heaven\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 20, 2025\nQuest46014431033\nDear Getaway23774218159,\n\nThank you so much for your wonderful review! We are delighted to know that you consider our restaurant a world-class Italian dining spot in Phu Quoc. It’s truly rewarding to hear that you enjoyed our pizzas, pastas, and especially our fresh vegetables – a highlight for our vegetarian guests.\n\nYour kind words about the quality of our ingredients and the flavors of our dishes mean a lot to our culinary team, who put great passion into every plate. We are especially thrilled that our pizza ranks among the best you’ve ever had!\n\nOn your next visit, we would be delighted for you to also explore our other dining venues at the resort, such as Wok & Curry, Daily Social, Unspoken Bar for creative cocktails with a vibrant atmosphere.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon for more memorable dining experiences.\n\nWarm regards,\nIL Tramonto Team\nRead more\nWritten August 21, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
