            "review_text": "mia m\n3 contributions\n0\nBest food wine and service\nJul 2025 • Family\nAbsolutely beautiful, my family shared carbonara lasagne and gnocchi and I really can’t pick which one was the best. They were all beautiful and authentic and the red wine was amazing too.. TRUNG was a very helpful waiter too.\nInsider tip:\nAbsolutely beautiful, my family shared carbonara lasagne and gnocchi and I really can’t pick which one was the best. They were all beautiful\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 29, 2025\nQuest46014431033\nDear miamG6117LP,\n\nThank you for your lovely review!\nWe’re delighted to hear you and your family enjoyed the food, wine, and service, and that Trung helped make your experience even better.\n\nIf you have time during your stay, we also recommend trying our other restaurants such as Wok & Curry, Flavor Fair, Daily Social,... — each offers a unique culinary style worth exploring.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon!\n\nBest regards,\nIL Tramonto Team\nRead more\nWritten July 31, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
