            "review_title": "Review at IL Tramonto",
            "review_text": "Grace H\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat Workers\nJul 2025 • Family\nThe workers were amazing and so nice especially, Anh, Duyen, and vivi they were all so friendly. Anh has a great smile and good english and Duyen would always be happy to see us and knitted us homemade gifts when it was our time to go home. I really enjoyed our stay and would recommend to anyone I come across thankyou!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 19, 2025\nQuest46014431033\nDear K1258RYgraceh,\n\nThank you for your heartfelt feedback! We're so touched to hear that Anh, Duyen, and Vivi made your stay so memorable — and how thoughtful of Duyen to send you off with handmade gifts. We’ll be sure to share your kind words with them.\n\nWe hope to welcome you back again soon. Don’t miss the chance to explore Daily Social, Wok & Curry, Flavor Fair, Pool Bar, and Unspoken Bar during your next visit!\n\nWarm regards,\nIL Tramonto Team\nRead more\nWritten July 28, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
